Z||000000||Doni Hagan||08-26-2001||12:54 AM||||After doing a search on rear deck scoops and seeing pictures of Fieros with Mustang scoops on the back, I went out yesterday and got myself one from a local yard. I'll admit that drilling holes in my trunk made little insects crawl under my skin but I got the thing installed and glassed in. DAMN, IT LOOKS GOOD! I'll admit I was inspired by Cadaver's black notchback. <P>BTW, Tom, I like your exhaust tips, too. I've been looking at the tips on my wife's Seville STS and wondering if she'd miss'em. I could always say the dog ate them or something...... Also, I'm searching for a new rear wing. Something different but not "ricey."<P>I'm waiting for AUS' side scoops to get here and IRM's quarter windows and then PAINT TIME!!! I'll post pix as soon as I get it done.  ||||reg||6
